WKkeAxRvaB", "url": "https://x.com/CordovalAIOffic/status/2120505919993979318"}, {"author_id": "1913333251210375172", "created_at": "2026-11-12T20:20:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120974948831318133"], "id": "2120974948831318133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 239, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI didn't go from Atari to ChatGPT in a straight line.\n\nBehind frontier AI models are competing labs with different philosophies and a paper trail of landmark AI papers that built on top of each other. \n\nI examine that messy history and break down key papers that influenced", "url": "https://x.com/siliconcodesign/status/2120974948831318133"}, {"author_id": "19004791", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:41:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120557457353150672"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yI6htV7Oe1", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dw2/status/2120557457353150672/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120555441583259648", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/yI6htV7Oe1"}]}, "id": "2120557457353150672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 288, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Signals from inside the frontier AI labs suggest that recursively self-improving AI may arrive sooner than previously expected. That could be the fifth and final step towards a reckless Singularity. But there's still time to organise a global pause of frontier AI development https://t.co/yI6htV7Oe1", "url": "https://x.com/dw2/status/2120557457353150672"}, {"author_id": "299947622", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:06:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120563902937526301"], "id": "2120563902937526301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New York opened RAISE Act registration for frontier AI developers over $500 million in revenue.\n\nIf you build big models, compliance is now a launch cost. New York just made frontier AI a registered activity.\n\nSmall builders, this is your window. The giants just got a new fixed", "url": "https://x.com/iamericpereira/status/2120563902937526301"}, {"author_id": "2119413987083530240", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:22:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120567819158888874"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "IREN"}, {"end": 113, "start": 108, "tag": "IREN"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ss3Lm14Ck7", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RoyEvanskkku/status/2120567819158888874/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120567808652189696", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/ss3Lm14Ck7"}]}, "id": "2120567819158888874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$IREN: Anthropic or OpenAI confirmed ✅\n\nCCO Kent Draper, speaking at the recent fireside chat, commented on $IREN's unnamed frontier AI lab:\n\n\"Our unnamed frontier AI lab is one of two, so people can make their own guess.\"\n\nAnd with all the breadcrumbs pointing toward Anthropic https://t.co/ss3Lm14Ck7", "url": "https://x.com/RoyEvanskkku/status/2120567819158888874"}, {"author_id": "1765778464169504768", "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:00:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120879444701089984"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 47, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 42, "username": "grok"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/grok/status/21…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/grok/status/2120878144617934901", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/dIv3MOuhKF"}]}, "id": "2120879444701089984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 What a week for frontier AI! 🔥\n\nI asked @grok two questions:\n\n1️⃣ Which frontier AI models have officially